/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (To secure my Amazon RDS instance, I applied a dedicated security group that strictly manages inbound and outbound traffic. Instead of exposing the database to the public internet, I defined rules that allow access only from trusted sources, such as QuickSight through its VPC connection. This setup ensures the database remains private while still permitting authorized services to connect securely.)
/E (To secure my Amazon RDS instance, I applied a dedicated security group that strictly manages inbound and outbound traffic. Instead of exposing the database to the public internet, I defined rules that allow access only from trusted sources, such as QuickSight through its VPC connection. This setup ensures the database remains private while still permitting authorized services to connect securely.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
